INSERT INTO `media` VALUES ('12c6106d-45fb-4da0-b569-1565cf9db556',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/uk4Vdu0tgiQ',NULL,'Tigray Testimonial Video','He expressed great happiness because he received the radio, and he was blessed by the Word of God','2026-05-19 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-23 11:04:53'),('1f47b279-4399-49cc-b18e-48cc428f3ab5',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/lf6Nc1_4rtQ',NULL,'Tigray Region Testimonial Video','My name is Giday, and I am from Shire. I listen to the  Radio Homes.It is difficult for me to explain everything. However, it is not difficult for me to speak about all that I have heard. What remains with me is this: that the Lord Jesus Christ died for me because of my sins. I have got a great change in my life Spritual. I listen all the time, and I also listen to the prayer program every evening. Praise be to God, and I thank Him.\"','2026-06-10 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-23 11:29:24'),('36cfc7a3-3c47-4171-987b-a9afe4886ad0',NULL,'youtube','https://youtube.com/shorts/iXX0PrFc-7w?feature=share',NULL,'Tigray Testimonial Video August 2026','I took this Radio Home from Mekelle to Atsbi. I gave the radio that I had taken to someone. The person to whom I gave the radio began listening to it together with his family, and they were transformed. They really liked it, and I was also very happy. Therefore, this radio is very important to us. It is becoming a source of healing for many people. Through this radio, people are listening to the Word of God, and many of them are healing.','2026-08-29 00:00:00','a5edf080-b699-4f7d-8d31-4c33eab3a6bb','2026-09-02 06:46:10'),('3b69bd7d-6d14-4bb9-af5b-ab2f5eefe547',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/ePj6OOAFuhc',NULL,'Amhara Region Testimonial Video','My name is Belete Eshetu. I was previously a follower of the Orthodox faith. I am blind and unable to read printed materials. Through the radio player I received, I listened to Bible teachings and Christian hymns. As I continued listening to the programs, I came to understand the Gospel, accepted Jesus Christ as my personal Savior, and became a Protestant Christian.\n\nThis radio player has been a great blessing in my life. It allows me to hear God\'s Word and grow in my faith. It is also very important for people like me who are unable to read. May God richly bless the people of Yemisrach Dimts Communication Service (YDCS) who provided this radio player for us.','2026-06-11 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-23 11:31:56'),('5363b604-20d9-4e9c-a6ec-42ce0da36c2e',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/fevNMaUOEkc',NULL,'Oromia Region July 2026 Testimonial Video','My name is Teacher Martisan Burusa. I live in Sebeta-Awash Woreda, I Worship at Meseret Kiristos Church. I am visually impaired; I cannot see with either of my eyes. We have received a Radio Homes. This radio is very important to us, especially for those of us who are visually impaired. These teachings not only bring new souls to Christ but also greatly encourage us who are already believers.\nThere is no one who can read the Bible to me. Because I lost the sight in both of my eyes for different reasons, the sound of the radio’s gospel message has brought light into my life. As a group, by listening to this Radio Home program together, six men and three women have accepted Christ and become new believers. Through listening to this radio, those of us who are visually impaired and those who can see have become one. It has brought us together and made us equal.\nMay God bless YDCS.\n','2026-07-30 00:00:00','a5edf080-b699-4f7d-8d31-4c33eab3a6bb','2026-09-01 12:19:06'),('82eeb39c-0bb1-4793-8b98-3a21753c6666',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/5oTazIwn_b8',NULL,'Oromia Testimonial Video','He introduces himself as Evangelist Jima Dame. He shares that eight years ago, his Aunt was not a follower of Jesus Christ. One day, his cousin heard a Bible study on Yemisrach Dimts radio via shortwave, accepted Jesus, and eventually his whole family became followers of Christ. Now, he say I\'m  organized 28 radio home groups, and  We are blessed by the Word of God.','2026-05-19 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-23 11:10:55'),('83e6955c-6bfa-4a3c-9045-0ffbe8e00e97',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/FdvpbLngodk',NULL,'Video Testimonies of Mr Reba From Oromia','Mr. Reba Ambase says:\n\nPeople who come to visit our area are gathered together. When they are assembled, I invite the elders and turn on the home radio tuned to the Good News Voice (Gospel Voice) station and tell them, “Listen.” After they have listened, I ask them, “Do you know this message?” These elders are six (6) people.\nMr. Ketema Kondala says:\n\nFirst, through this home radio tuned to the Good News Voice station, I came to understand and believe in the Lord. We would play the radio teaching program on the road for people to listen to, and through hearing this teaching, eleven (11) people believed in the Lord Jesus. After we moved from Abbuu Sarkamaa to Bishoftu, during our free time we listen to the home radio. People gather around us and listen as well. Here, six (6) people have heard the message and believed in the Lord. There are also others who are saying that they will believe.','2026-06-16 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-22 09:17:26'),('86a184be-f13f-40a7-872c-b17d49efb6f5',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/SvIWhWhcyjw',NULL,'Oomia Region Testimonial Video July, 2026','Bekela Beka, Jiregna’s Father\nWe had received Radio Home from YDCS. In the morning, from 6:00 am-8:00 am, because my son does not take medicine at that time, we used to take the Radio Home turn it on, and listen to it. In the evening, from 4:00 pm- 6:00 pm since people were sleeping, we would reduse the volume and listened quietly.When we listened to the teaaching, for a few seconds at the end there is song. Whenever we heard that song, we would become happy and sing song. As a result, everyone who was sick and staying in the hospital would wake up and listen to it. Even people there who could not understand the language in which we were singing would ask us about it. We would tell them, “We are listening to the Word of God.”\nFor those who were interested, I also shared the Word of God with them. We listened to this radio together with a husband, his wife, and their child in the Hospital. They came to believe in the Lord, accepted Him as their Savior. Whenever we told them about the power of the teachings we had heard on the radio, it touched their hearts, and they listened to us very attentively. They would say, “You are truly people of God,” and listen to the Word of the Lord through us.\nI want to thank you, the YDCS workers, because when came to your office you gave me this Radio Home. May God bless you. In addition, I have been listening to Yemisrach Dimts Radio for 23 years. Because I love the message and the voice of the program, I listen to it very much.\n','2026-07-31 00:00:00','a5edf080-b699-4f7d-8d31-4c33eab3a6bb','2026-09-04 13:00:21'),('87c88a7a-eeb3-446c-8007-a78a310902f8',NULL,'youtube','https://youtube.com/shorts/A_nqBUCvOj8',NULL,'Amhara Region Testimonial July, 2026','             Mesfin’s Testimony\nMy name is Mesfin Tedesa. I’m living here in Wurgessaa town. I was born and raised here. I also came to believe in the Jesus Lord here, at the Wurgessa Mekane Yesus Evangelical Church. I am a clinical nursing professional.  I am one of the people who received this Bible study program Radio Home With my family that has come to us in audio form. My family and I listen to this Radio Home. Through these lessons, we are learning how to read and study the Word of God. It has benefited us in many ways. When we listen to this radio, the weakiness of our spiritual life is renewed. My son Jakob listens to this radio all the time, he turns it on every evening, listens to it, and eventually falls asleep.\n\nThank you very much for bringing this Radio Home to our town! Previously, it was available only through Shortwave, but now it has been improved and prepared so that everyone can receive it and listen to it. This is very good.  Sometimes I take this Radio Home to the Health Center where work place and listen to it there. People living in this area also hear this program. The fact that Word of God has been prepared and delivered in the form of a Radio Home program encourages people to listen to it.\n\n','2026-07-27 00:00:00','a5edf080-b699-4f7d-8d31-4c33eab3a6bb','2026-09-07 12:08:56'),('88206ee9-161a-495c-8d38-6f307167bc41',NULL,'youtube','https://youtube.com/shorts/1FOlwrvqXzs?feature=share',NULL,'Amhara Region Testimonial Video August 2026','Since receiving this Radio Homes, we have benefited greatly from it. We are able to sit in our homes or in different places and easily listen to the Word of God. We have gained a lot of knowledge because the program explains the Bible from the beginning, including how it was discovered, how it came to be, who wrote it, and how it was written. It has also been helpful because, wherever we are, we can listen to the Word of God and worship songs through the radio. When we are praying at home or doing our work, we turn it on and listen to it. These Radio homes explain the Word of God clearly to us.\nThis radio is especially helpful for people who cannot read or write and for elderly people. They can simply turn on the radio and easily understand the Word of God. This radio is also being distributed to people who cannot got it, enabling them to access and understand the Word of the Lord more easily.\n','2026-08-30 00:00:00','a5edf080-b699-4f7d-8d31-4c33eab3a6bb','2026-09-02 06:55:18'),('8f33e04d-60d5-40a3-8260-9f7563cfba8c',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/2ARD-a2Rd80',NULL,'Tigray Testimonial Video','This is the Tigrigna TTB released on a loudspeaker in the marketplace to attract listeners.','2026-04-14 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-23 11:03:34'),('bc982495-4804-4bed-a099-d541a263baac',NULL,'photo','https://ydcsradiobackend.elacodes.com/uploads/78b7f42e-fb56-443e-9dd2-ad06f0319e21.jpg',NULL,'Tigray Region Testimonial image','Her name is Hildana. She came to Mekelle from Atsbi Wemberta in the Tigray Region. She received radio programs from others, and after listening to them, she came to believe in the Lord Jesus Christ.\n\nShe also encouraged her family members to listen to the programs. As a result, her entire family believed in the Lord as well.\n\nThe picture shows Hildana listening to the radio programs','2026-06-16 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-24 13:11:47'),('c5939c1b-7b93-4a47-b646-7a0ef0203dac',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/Y7h8Zoq-sI8',NULL,'','His name is Sheikh Hassan Ibrahim. Through listening to the Radio Home Group programs, he accepted Jesus Christ as his Lord and Savior. Later, he publicly confessed his faith by being baptised in a church.\n\nHis story is a powerful testimony of faith, salvation, and the transforming power of the Gospel. It is also a clear reminder of how God is using the Radio Home ministry to touch hearts and change lives in different communities.\nHis name is Sheikh Hassan Ibrahim. Through listening to the Radio Home Group programs, he accepted Jesus Christ as his Lord and Savior. Later, he publicly confessed his faith by being baptized in a church.\n','2026-03-17 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-11 17:25:54'),('cf6a444b-d6ed-48bf-a3b9-ae8a5b80efb9',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/FBtDzlftHhE',NULL,'Oromia Region Testimonial Video July 2026','                    Jiregna’s Testimony\n  My name is Jiregna Bekela Beka. I was born in the Guji Zone of the Oromia Region. I came to Addis Ababa to medical treatment, because I was sick. When we reached Kallit, they referred me to Ras Desta Hospital. My father asked them to provide with a stretcher. When we reached the Addis Ababa Autobustera station, I became weak and collapsed.\nWe stayed at Ras Desta Hospital for 12 days. One day, they said that ‘He had died’ and referred me to Paul’s Hospital. However, the hospital refused to admit me. We spent one day there, and on the second day, my father signed the consent form, and they operated on my head. After they treated me, I recovered. Praise be to God.\nWhen I was sick, my father brought Radio Home that YDCS was given to him. We listened to the teachings of Bible study from that radio every evening and every morning in the hospital. My father turn on the radio for me and put a place it beside my head, and I would listen to it.\nThrough these teachings, I learned that the Bible was written over a period of 1,500 years. I also learned that the Bible has two authors: human beings and God. It was written by more than 40 people. I learned that the Bible has survived and surpassed all other books, and although it was burned in many places, it overcame all these challenges and reached us today.\nI also learned about Noah building the Ship and how there was only one door through which people could enter. This shows that there is only one door through which we can enter into God’s salvation, and that door is Jesus Christ.\nWhen my mother was pregnant with me, she used to listen to this radio. She was very encouraged by it. Later, however, the radio broke. But now, when she hears that a radio has been given to us, she is very happy.\nMy head that sick me now be healed. Now I give thanks to God. I will return to my studies, which were interrupted because of my illness.\nMay God bless YDCS for giving us this radio. continue to doing the work of God and preaching His Gospel.\n','2026-07-30 00:00:00','a5edf080-b699-4f7d-8d31-4c33eab3a6bb','2026-09-04 12:49:09'),('d6f11a32-25e1-4bab-a1bf-dea4a6910c28',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/ZFGYekJGM6A',NULL,'Oromia Region Testimonial Video','My name is Kumessa Dechasa. “Through listening to the Radio Home programs, the spiritual life of both my family and me has been greatly transformed. This radio has become like a teacher to us. It clearly explains the Word of God from the Old Testament to the New Testament in a way that is easy to understand. Through the programs, we are learning many new spiritual truths, and since I began listening regularly, I have become spiritually stronger.\nMy children also listen together with others as a group. In our church, discipleship classes are conducted using this Radio Home Study Bible. Our participants, in the confirmation classes, are asked questions based on the lessons they have learned from the radio, and those who answer correctly are encouraged and awarded certificates.\nThis radio ministry has become a great help to many people in our community, including those who cannot read or write.','2026-06-17 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-23 11:12:37'),('eba94405-5e14-47eb-aada-f28bcba1012c',NULL,'youtube','https://youtu.be/Lie-AL6Y3GQ',NULL,'Oromia Testimonial Video','This photo shows radio home groups listening to the Word of God.','2026-05-20 00:00:00','05c3ad16-12dd-4040-ae59-a946e09b3343','2026-08-23 11:09:36');
